      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "BREAKING: Google just proved AI data centers in space actually work\n\nProject Suncatcher's first satellite, built with @planet and launched on a SpaceX rocket with 4 TPUs on board, verified the physics: Google sent a prompt from Earth, a TPU in orbit ran Gemma inference, and the full answer was beamed back down. \n\nSpaceX is launching its StarMind satellites with NVIDIA GPUs on Starship in late 2027. \n\nKardashev Type II civilization INCOMING",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "ns123abc",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2048822563821035520/7nxCFEnk_200x200.jpg",
