        "id": "2116077196179656963",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Kirk_Loco",
        "text": "Well, now I am a free man and the dust is starting to settle I can now be FULLY transparent without repercussion. \n\n@GlobalAffairs, aka, @elonmusk picked up the legal tab for my court proceedings these past few months. \n\nThis was only possible due to the relentless hard work of @ezralevant of @RebelNewsOnline who not only brought @laoisedebrun on board with Padraig Langsch, but pressed X legal department to pursue my case in the interests of Free Speech. \n\nWaking up a free man after two years of daily persecution is a strange but liberating feeling. \n\nI will continue to promote http://www.irishfreespeech.com for the cases of @RossLahive1 and Hugh Fagan who are facing Lawfare outside of X's remit and require funding so Laoise and Padraig can clear their names too.",
